description: BotFazer foundation phase — structure and contracts before agents
globs: app/**/*.py, tests/**/*.py, app/schemas/**
alwaysApply: true
---

# BotFazer foundation rules

- Do NOT add LangGraph, agent executors, or marketing pipelines unless the user explicitly requests phase 3+.
- New entities MUST be added to `app/schemas/contracts.py` before DB or API.
- All secrets via `app/core/config.py` and `.env` — never hardcode.
- Inbound text MUST pass `app/core/security.sanitize_payload` before processing or logging.
- API handlers stay thin; business logic belongs in `app/domain/` and `app/services/`.
- Every new endpoint requires tests in `tests/`.
